# ===== Confirm prompts (destructive actions) =====
prompt_paste_section => Paste clipboard into current section?\nThis will overwrite the current section.
prompt_clear_section => Clear all notes & events of the current section?
prompt_swap_section => Swap the player's and opponent's notes in this section?
prompt_copy_beat => Copy the target beat and overwrite the current section?
prompt_duet_notes => Balance this section's two sides?\nCopy the notes of the fuller side to the emptier side.
prompt_mirror_notes => Mirror every note of this section?
